	"Name": "Nommer's Craftables",
	"Author": "PriestessFaye",
	"AuthorLabel": "Nommers",
	"Description": "~~Nommer's Craftables~~\n<br />\n<br />Hey there!\u00A0 Today I present to you my very first mod.\u00A0 This mod changes the colors of various craftables, and tools that are in the game.\u00A0 \u00A0 There are white and then wood variations of each color!\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />~ChangeLogs~\n<br />In 1.1, I updated the white wood and dark wood craftables, hopefully they feel a little less bright but still keep their colorfulness.\u00A0\n<br />I also added in a lighter wood color that I hope matches closer to the vanilla minecraft than the dark wood!\n<br />\n<br />~Future Plans~ (in order)\n<br />Vanilla Buildings with the colors to match the craftables\n<br />Hud Outlines to match everything\n<br />\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Leave a comment for any suggestions or tips, they are always appreciated!\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />I hope you all have a great day, and thank you for viewing this mod!",
